The page ties event-stream and XZ Utils to the same structural condition. The four topics are the page's related defense topics.
notes:
The page names two other kill chains in its text, and links four defense topics.

The page says event-stream exposed the same structural condition in 2018, and that XZ Utils would be built on it in 2024: critical infrastructure maintained by unpaid volunteers under pressure. It adds that the XZ Utils chain makes the argument for funding maintainers from the attack side. Read them beside this deck for that condition.

The page's related defense topics are vulnerability management, CI/CD and supply chain, container security, and network security. CI/CD stands for continuous integration and continuous delivery.
